# Line endings (Sept 30 2026). core.autocrlf is false on this machine, so an
# editor that saves CRLF used to rewrite every line of a file in git: d52fbda
# showed ~9,000 changed lines for a 64-line edit. Store text as LF; Windows
# launchers keep CRLF so cmd.exe reads them right.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
